  "description": "Self-hosted, Sentry-style session analytics and diagnostics SDK for Blazor WebAssembly apps: browser sessions (navigation with route templates, clicks), .NET and JavaScript exceptions with structured stacks (file:line from uploaded PDBs), network spans (every HttpClient call, OTLP), Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS, FCP, TTFB), app start and long tasks. Uploads to the same backend as Immons.Tools.Maui.SessionReplay, with PII scrubbing and remote configuration. No DOM recording.",
